        "original_id": "0c47980b-3644-54c7-9866-cadbd63ba931",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ainslee's Magazine, The Australian Women's Weekly, Strand Magazine, Woman's Day, New Idea, The Prince and Betty\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- People: Nene King\n- Places: United States, United Kingdom, Australia, Sydney\n- Roles: editor\n\nFacts:\n- Ainslee's Magazine was an American literary periodical published from 1897 to December 1926.\n- The Prince and Betty was originally published in Ainslee's Magazine in the United States in January 1912.\n- The Prince and Betty was also published in a slightly different form as a serial in Strand Magazine in the United Kingdom between February and April 1912.\n- The Australian Women's Weekly is an Australian monthly women's magazine published by Bauer Media Group in Sydney.\n- Nene King was the former editor of the Australian women's magazines Woman's Day, New Idea, and The Australian Women's Weekly.",
